# Bullseye: always resync on live OHLC

- **NEVER** propose, suggest, or implement removing / skipping / throttling `syncBullseyeViewIfActive` (or `frameChartTo24hFocus`) on live OHLC / trade / ticker ticks.
- Bullseye must stay centered **always** while active — including every live candle update, not only enter / roll / setData / resize.
- If live updates feel heavy, fix the **cost** of framing/overlay work. Do **not** fix hitch by dropping Bullseye live resync.
- Do not re-propose “only reframe on enter/roll/setData/resize” as a Bullseye performance idea. That proposal is banned.
